# Build context for Dockerfile.java21-tests only.
#
# BuildKit uses <dockerfile-path>.dockerignore in preference to the root .dockerignore,
# which is what this file is for. Two differences from the root one, both deliberate:
#
#   * src/test is KEPT. The root file drops it because the production image ships a jar
#     built with -DskipTests. This image exists to run those tests, and without them the
#     build still succeeds while Maven reports "No tests to run" -- which reads like a
#     passing suite.
#   * infra/, schema/ and frontend/src are KEPT, because tests read them at runtime.
#
# Credentials are excluded at any depth, not just at the root: the pattern `.env.*` on
# its own would not match infra/mysql-test/.env.mysql-test.
.git
.gitattributes
.idea
.vscode
.deploy
target
uploads
docs
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!infra/aws/.env.aws.example
infra/aws/.env.aws
infra/mysql-test/.env.mysql-test
infra/aws/releases
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
**/*.iml
**/.DS_Store
regression-test-output.docx
db-backups

# Collected job postings from local pipeline runs. Never belongs in an image layer:
# real third-party content, and a copy that outlives the directory it came from.
.pipeline-batches
